{"2507630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Party 丧尸派对", "steam_appid": 2507630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "&quot;Zombie Party&quot; is an anti-superhero-themed strategy game. You need to play the role of a chaotic ability user GRAVEDIGGER, and use your super power to summon the zombie army to destroy the land that is governed by the government and the PARLIAMENT OF FIVE, The established order of power.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507630/extras/fd588cf2dea5dbfe6687f42fddee4778.webp?t=1728718977\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507630/extras/0535ce98469e8167ad4fcb66ef8e4ad5.poster.avif?t=1728718977\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507630/extras/0535ce98469e8167ad4fcb66ef8e4ad5.webm?t=1728718977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507630/extras/0535ce98469e8167ad4fcb66ef8e4ad5.mp4?t=1728718977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can use your superpowers to summon thousands of zombies and form an army of the living dead loyal to you. But be aware that once summoned, most of them will tend to act according to their bloodthirsty instincts. At this time, you need to summon more powerful special infected. They will perform their respective duties and become an important aid for you to fight against the enemy.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2507630/extras/28c080454b8304817c005fb3186bcd7c.webp?t=1728718977\" width=616 height=38 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au